_model: news-post
---
title: MAN Network becomes FSF Associate Member
---
pub_date: 2025-07-10
---
body:

We became an **associate member** of the [Free Software Foundation](https://www.fsf.org/) in July 2025.

We appreciate the FSF's work on software freedom and open-source principles, and we support that mission as associate members.

![FSF Member](/files/site/fsf-member.png)
